// Signing settings for the app target, kept out of `project.pbxproj` so a clone does not
// arrive carrying someone else's Apple Developer team.
//
// `#include?` is the optional form: with no `Local.xcconfig` present this file is empty
// and `DEVELOPMENT_TEAM` stays unset, which is what a fresh clone wants, and what the
// macOS build wants for good, since it signs ad hoc. Only a device build needs a team:
// pick one in Xcode's Signing & Capabilities tab, or write it here.
//
// To keep your own team out of `git status`, create `App/Local.xcconfig`, which is
// ignored:
//
//     DEVELOPMENT_TEAM = ABCDE12345
//
#include? "Local.xcconfig"
